</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/4/01 10:49:36 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=59.topic&index=1>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> tofs</span><hr size=1> Lyissa quit trying to find me a date ~ me and Icereaver are very happy together now thanks (sorry Trueshot I know you've been replaced as my fav but deal with it)<br>
<br>
We are not going to tofs tonight, consensus was no time to try and get any more keys.  We might look at doing this during the weekend.  Also see Zilben's post on the TOFS AAR - he had some great ideas and perhaps we could scout out the 4th floor etc. and acquire more keys. Would be great someday to get a screen shot of the GL on the top floor - or floating out from the top hehe - if it has windows.  <br>
<br>
PS:  Everyone did stash keys in bank, yes?<br>
<br>
Presently known keyholders:<br>
Tressia: 2nd floor<br>
Exee:  2nd/3rd floor<br>
Ssolaria: 2nd floor<br>
Galdiwen: 3rd floor<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/bgoldenlegion.showLocalUserPublicProfile?login=cyri>Cyri</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/4/01 12:14:36 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=59.topic&index=2>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: TOFS</span><hr size=1> Well I go wherever Lyissa goes so I'm game for whatever.  I would be the favorite shaman she was talking about. <!--EZCODE EMOTICON START :) --><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/smile.gif ALT=":)"><!--EZCODE EMOTICON END--> <br>
<br>
Looks like it may be hard to get ahold of the keys so not sure if you still want to do this Lyissa?<br>
<br>
See ya on there tonight Lyissa wherever we decide to group.<br>
<br>
PS - Oh one more thing I think I'm gonna try to get those Kromrif leggings tonight cause I already have the acid. <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/4/01 12:56:11 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=59.topic&index=3>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> stuff</span><hr size=1> Ok, please to make up my mind where to go tonight thanks.  If cyri is going to finish legging quest that surely is on velious in GD belnor needs to finish that as well, and Tooh, and not sure who else, so I'll keep my ivy arse parked there.  BTW I believe we should have a good group for final giant slaying part of this quest.  I'd like to do it but don't have scepter or acid yet.    <br>
<br>
*Ranger at large<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uexidorgangleri.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Exidor Gangleri</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/4/01 1:20:55 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=59.topic&index=4>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: stuff</span><hr size=1> From what I've read the respawn time of the broodmother is a few hours after completing the quest.  So, accomplishing the end result for several people will take awhile.  Also, I've seen complaints about it taking time to get the Blood Dire Wolf to spawn.<br>
<br>
Other important things I've read about this, that I can neither confirm nor deny:<br>
<br>
Only give the control harness to the Broodmother in the wurm caves.  If she is out already, that means someone else already started the quest and probably failed at completing it.<br>
<br>
Wait for Fergul to start running to the zone before attacking him.  (He despawns when the broodmother attacks his partner and respawns and starts running.)  He doesn't have the leggings until he starts running.<br>
<br>
There have been reports of odd behavior of the broodmother, including her becoming Fergul's pet...<br>
<br>
<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/4/01 3:44:35 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=59.topic&index=5>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> broodmother</span><hr size=1> Exidor, I have heard all these things as well.  Indeed will more than likely be a tricky quest to finish.<br>
<br>
*Ranger at large <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/ussolaria.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Ssolaria</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/5/01 10:17:26 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=59.topic&index=6>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Small correction</span><hr size=1> I have keys to both 2 and 3 floors.<br>
