Ssolaria <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/17/01 6:07:48 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=59.topic&index=7>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> lets do it</span><hr size=1> Ok I got you in velious now, let's do it - I wanna scout these other floors anyway because we are going back to own tofs 4+ in May.<br>
